# cosearch2: wire64b's w63-014-bottom-t.ideal (7x8-014 in a 7x9 box, rows -2..6, bottom pockets
# wired for real) with EVERY top input moved OFF the plane, so the pocket tool / the assist leave
# all top cells free: A (1,4,1) and lowered (1,3,1), the T parker P_T (3,3,1), B (1,5,1) (also
# quasi-powers A through (1,5), as the in-plane (2,5) did), U (0,4,1), the left stack (-2,1,1)
# (P1 direct + P0 by QC through P1's cell), the right stack (4,2,1) (as before).
design designs/piston-door-3x3/tracks/cosearch2/seeds/w63-014-bottom.txt
